      "factual_description": "KOIAI's official site presents the LIVE TOUR 2026 ‘Starting Over’ in TOKYO Release Event — Talk & Live at Yokohama Bay Hall on Sunday, October 25, 2026, with doors at 2:00 PM and the event beginning at 3:00 PM. The ticket is ¥5,000 including tax for an all-standing event, with a separate drink charge. The program includes a KOIAI live performance plus a talk segment with guest MC Ken Ayugai. The event accompanies the October 28 release of the Blu-ray documenting KOIAI's July 31 Tokyo performance at Meijiza during the Starting Over tour / HEAVY KAWAII FES 2026; attendees can purchase the Blu-ray at the venue before general release, and purchasers are eligible for the announced signing session. KOIAI's official profile identifies the current five-member lineup as Mirei Sakurada on voice, Li-sa-X and Hazuki on guitars, Yunika Impact on bass and Kanade Sato on drums; the current lineup was completed when Yunika joined in March 2026.",
