      "editorial": {
        "en": {
          "why_it_matters": "The reason to keep this on RADAR is the moment in KOIAI's own transition, not a generic release promotion. The five-member formation only became complete this year, and Starting Over is the first EP from that lineup; now the same phase is being turned into an official live document. Hearing the band play while the event looks back at the Meijiza performance puts Li-sa-X and Hazuki's twin-guitar architecture, Kanade Sato's drumming and the new rhythm-and-vocal configuration in a useful before-and-after frame.",
          "trip_verdict": "If October already puts you in Tokyo or Yokohama, attend if convenient, especially if technical Japanese rock and twin-guitar writing are part of the trip. I would fit it around rarer master, farewell or one-off Kanto dates rather than reorganize the itinerary specifically for this release event.",
